{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade","id":871737,"title":"Why Do Changelings have a Masquerade?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-22T14:31:44-07:00","id":871737,"title":"Why Do Changelings have a Masquerade?","content":"There's one thing about ctd that i still don't understand. Why do changelings keep their masquerade,why when do they form freeholds they try to solve their problems and resist the Hunstmen with only their freehold resources and nothing else? maybe it's silly,but to em at least,it's preatty unrealistic that the changelings would not want to tell everyone about Faerie and the Fae. they could band togehter and Drop The Mask in live television. isn't it the most effective way to fight recapture and prevent more people from being brought back in the future,to have everyone knowing about it?,the world leaders would have no choice! as soon as people in general become aware that they might be snatached to be tortured would demand from their presidents to have protection. how would the huntsman or loyalists grab people if there's soldiers with iron knives and iron bullets preparing to find them? i'm pretty sure there's a reason,but i can't see it,why have changelings never tried to ask for help from the military?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T14:52:35-07:00","id":871751,"title":"","content":"Sure, reveal yourself to the world. Reveal yourself to <i>anything that might be watching exactly who and where you are.</i> That's not going to backfire, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T15:00:06-07:00","id":871760,"title":"","content":"Two words: Government Experimentation. <br /> <br /> Immediately preceded by declarations that it was someone messing with the video feed and adding CGI into it. Add a healthy dose of technobabble and you'll get the majority of people going 'ok, I don't really understand that but it sounds legit'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T15:43:35-07:00","id":871808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=871760#post871760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Two words: Government Experimentation.<br /> <br /> Immediately preceded by declarations that it was someone messing with the video feed and adding CGI into it. Add a healthy dose of technobabble and you'll get the majority of people going 'ok, I don't really understand that but it sounds legit'.</div> </div> </div> </div>i don't know man,i feel like if 600 changelings manage do to something supernatural in a public space,there's no way the goverment could cover that up,too many smartphones,too many social network accounts. and once everyone knows chnagelings are a thing,well i think thered a <i>lot </i>racism against them. but shit,at least if the goverment know arcadias is there in the backyward,wouldnt it be worth it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T15:45:38-07:00","id":871814,"title":"","content":"Mirrors's World of Darkness Revealed chapter does a decent explanation of the problems with it.<br /> <br /> I'll give some insight on this later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T15:50:14-07:00","id":871827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=871751#post871751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure, reveal yourself to the world. Reveal yourself to <i>anything that might be watching exactly who and where you are.</i> That's not going to backfire, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>that's the great risk of a major revelation,would it be worth revealing yourself to everyone in the chance that you might be better protected,right now im thinking yes. there's no country that likes foregin forces attacking","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T15:51:07-07:00","id":871829,"title":"","content":"The moment you can mass produce Cold Iron, I bet the Gentry will call upon this or that ancient loophole in the Wyrd to exchange that Bane for another.<br /> <br /> Also, simply knowing that a danger exists is very far from knowing enough to properly defend yourself from it. Huntsmen cannot be detected as supernatural with magic, much less infra-red. And the vast majority of mortals doesn't have Contracts, Tokens or Approaches to fight or evade Huntsmen. There is no way to constantly watch over every single portal to the Hedge or catalogue every single hobgoblin and Gentry.<br /> <br /> Last but not least, you can't just reveal the existence of fae to the whole world without the masquerade of other supernaturals being removed in short order.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T15:56:02-07:00","id":871834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=871829#post871829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The moment you can mass produce Cold Iron, I bet the Gentry will call upon this or that ancient loophole in the Wyrd to exchange that Bane for another.<br /> <br /> Also, simply knowing that a danger exists is very far from knowing enough to properly defend yourself from it. Huntsmen cannot be detected as supernatural with magic, much less infra-red. And the vast majority of mortals doesn't have Contracts, Tokens or Approaches to fight or evade Huntsmen. There is no way to constantly watch over ebery single portal to the Hedge or catalogue every single hobgoblin and Gentry.<br /> <br /> Last but not least, you can't just reveal the existence of fae to the whole world without the masquerade of other supernaturals being removed in short order.</div> </div> </div> </div>honestly i think 90% of the changelings think any damage a revelation would to the world would be worth it,it would probably cause wars,massive panic,riots. the number of hunters would increase sevenfold. but if that means there would be help against the gentry,it'd be worth it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T16:07:48-07:00","id":871847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=871834#post871834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it would probably cause wars,massive panic,riots.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you are woefully uninformed about exactly what type of circumstances the chaotic children of the Wyrd thrive under.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T16:10:34-07:00","id":871850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=871847#post871847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Son, I think you are woefully uninformed about exactly what type of circumstances the chaotic children of the Wyrd thrive under.<br /> <br /> <i>Knife falls, Gentleman calls</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>oh,i didnt see this angle","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T16:10:36-07:00","id":871851,"title":"","content":"I don't see why Changelings would be ok revealing themselves to the Gentry and Huntsmen like that for little to no real protection. Governments in CofD already do know, and groups like VALKYRIE protect key individuals from abduction, but are powerless to stop abduction in general. They will kill Changelings before they allow Changelings to set off mass panics like you describe.<br /> <br /> Considering Changelings by their nature can open portals to the Hedge, I'd expect the public would see hem more as spreading threat of Gentry abduction, and &quot;protection&quot; would be in the form of cold iron walled, mirrorless, quarantine-centers. That or straight up trading them back to the Gentry in return for protection for the broader community.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-22-2016, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T16:39:57-07:00","id":871870,"title":"","content":"I think at least part of it is the logistics needed to reveal that Changelings (and by extension the Fey) are a real thing. I mean let's go with the simple one of just revealing themselves on live television. Problem the first would be the, reasonable, risk that the live show is actually running with a 5-15 second delay. Because if that happens then you run the risk of someone who doesn't want the information getting out cutting the feed, technical difficulty sign goes up plan failed. So you need to hit a lot of different shows broadcasting live.<br /> <br /> You'd also need to perform all these hits as close to simultaneously as possible since that makes it more difficult to discredit later incidents as copy cat incidents. A large group of them can still be listed off as a massive prank, but the larger the group, the more targets hit, the greater the distance between target, and the closer to synchronized the events are the more absurdly organized a group of pranksters would need to be to pull it off. (In theory you could probably get it up to the point where the most likely cover up for it being real would require something like all the world leaders getting together and planning this out in secret for no reason. At which point fairies are probably the story most will believe.)<br /> <br /> The big problem I'm seeing to this (aside from getting enough members and coordinating properly) would be other masquerades. I mean I might be getting a bit of the old World of Darkness mixed in with my knowledge of Chronicles, but there are more than a few organizations that have a vested interest in the world maintaining the policy of &quot;vampires, wizards, werewolves, fairies and the like are all make believe&quot; who would probably have some objections to finding out something like this was being planned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T17:38:21-07:00","id":871914,"title":"","content":"I tend to think of the World of Darkness as a more sinister setting than the real world, and it's not just the supernatural: You've got shadowy conspiracies, people equivalent to the Men in Black or SCP who cover everything up, and they have fewer moral qualms about what they do. I've borrowed a friend's organization of Delta 13 for my Chronicle setting, and their objective is to maintain the &quot;status quo&quot; which largely amounts to destroying or locking up everything that deviates from their perception of normal.<br /> <br /> I think part of the reason the Masquerade is maintained is because the Gentry are going along with the apparent genre conventions of Earth. If the existence of Changelings became public knowledge, the Gentry might think, &quot;Oh, hey, Earth's decided to swap over to High Fantasy, so we can go wild with our magic!&quot; Cue mortals being treated as faceless extras in a disaster movie as Smaug knocks over the Tokyo Tower, numerous supervillains battle over who gets to put their face on Mount Rushmore, and Lawful Stupid Paladins ride around town executing jaywalkers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T17:53:07-07:00","id":871924,"title":"","content":"Every changeling feels the urge to hide. Every changeling wants to make their way back home.<br /> <br /> Sure, perhaps you hide in plain sight. Perhaps you find your home among the paparazzi, under the spotlight, in front of the camera. Maybe it makes you feel brave. It makes you feel like you're daring the True Fae to come and get you, in front of everyone.<br /> <br /> But those changelings are a minority. Most changelings don't want attention; they just want to find their way back home.<br /> <br /> See, the True Fae take people stealthily and send their Huntsmen and Loyalists, they play their games and stay far from the mundane world. But what if coming clean to the world meant that they could be more bold? What if they could get away with worse and worse? Or more terrifyingly, what if they disguised themselves as the most mundane things? If everyone's eyes are on you, the changeling making the spectacle, nobody's watching the crowd. Nobody's checking if someone has a whiff of cloves or a hint of horns or strange eyes. What if your Keeper was just a stranger in the bus?<br /> <br /> It wouldn't be safer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T18:08:11-07:00","id":871940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowKnight1224</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=871924#post871924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Every changeling feels the urge to hide. Every changeling wants to make their way back home.<br /> <br /> Sure, perhaps you hide in plain sight. Perhaps you find your home among the paparazzi, under the spotlight, in front of the camera. Maybe it makes you feel brave. It makes you feel like you're daring the True Fae to come and get you, in front of everyone.<br /> <br /> But those changelings are a minority. Most changelings don't want attention; they just want to find their way back home.<br /> <br /> See, the True Fae take people stealthily and send their Huntsmen and Loyalists, they play their games and stay far from the mundane world. But what if coming clean to the world meant that they could be more bold? What if they could get away with worse and worse? Or more terrifyingly, what if they disguised themselves as the most mundane things? If everyone's eyes are on you, the changeling making the spectacle, nobody's watching the crowd. Nobody's checking if someone has a whiff of cloves or a hint of horns or strange eyes. What if your Keeper was just a stranger in the bus?<br /> <br /> It wouldn't be safer.</div> </div> </div> </div>i forgot,the huntsman and fae can be adaptable on their own way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T18:36:02-07:00","id":871956,"title":"","content":"I believe it boils down to &quot;If humans can figure out where you live, how long would it take to your Keeper's agents to do the same then?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T19:58:19-07:00","id":872018,"title":"","content":"but the upside is that now,everyone would so scared of the fae,the would throw grenades,bazookas and sent heavily armed personal every time there's even a slight chance of the true fae appearing on earth","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T20:17:14-07:00","id":872033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=872018#post872018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but the upside is that now,everyone would so scared of the fae,the would throw grenades,bazookas and sent heavily armed personal every time there's even a slight chance of the true fae appearing on earth</div> </div> </div> </div>Downside of that upside: That would include turning on other humans for being different, and of course, Changelings. In real life, we've got places that abuse and kill children for alleged witchcraft.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Up the airy mountain,<br /> Down the rushy glen,<br /> We dare not go a-hunting<br /> For fear of little men<br /> <br /> -&quot;The Fairies&quot; by William Allington </div> </div> </div>I'd expect a midget genocide, among other things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T20:23:37-07:00","id":872041,"title":"","content":"yeah <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />,there's no easy to solve the arcadia problem,but i feel like changelings isolationist altitulde may not be the better way","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-22T20:47:39-07:00","id":872067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=872041#post872041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">yeah <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />,there's no easy to solve the arcadia problem,but i feel like changelings isolationist altitulde may not be the better way</div> </div> </div> </div> How about more communication and sharing of resources between Freeholds, then? The Hedge is treacherous by default, but with the right adjustments, there could be more Trods that connect Freeholds with minimal risk. There will be a lot of diplomacy to do, but I think it would be worth it. Changelings that know how to hide Internet footprints and protect computers in general could volunteer to teach other changelings. The same goes for other skills that are important in Freeholds. <br /> <br /> In fact, this is pretty much a story seed. The next part is figuring out the less obvious difficulties they'd face, how it could go wrong and how it could be sabotaged. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T06:21:34-07:00","id":872316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=872041#post872041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">yeah <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />,there's no easy to solve the arcadia problem,but i feel like changelings isolationist altitulde may not be the better way</div> </div> </div> </div>Going public would be even worse, in literally every way.<br /> <br /> The balance between isolationism and cooperation is definitely one of the themes Changeling explores, but even that is subservient to the big need all changelings share: Safety. All changelings want to be safe. The ways in which they achieve that will vary from one individual changeling to another, but if changelings are creatures of duplicity, secrecy, chaos (unpredictability), bindings, barriers and carefully chosen words, it's for a reason.<br /> <br /> And that reason is Safety.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T20:14:06-07:00","id":872833,"title":"","content":"I don't see mechanics for it in the 2e pledge previews, but in first edition Ensorcelling somebody required a point of glamour per person. Mass Ensorcellment was impossible because of this, and without being Ensorcelled there's very little the average person can do to prevent Fae attacks. Sure, you know they exist and you even know their weakness to cold iron, but you can't fight what you can't see. A mass public reveal is worse than useless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T10:41:51-07:00","id":873175,"title":"","content":"I'm not a specialist of Changeling in the CoD (I knew it better in the classical WoD) but I read the Changeling the Lost and, about going public, several thoughts came into my mind:<br /> <br /> 1)- If you think it's a good plan, I bet that other Changelings wouldtoo, but not all of them. Most will be scared. So, if we consider that a big city might have up to 150 Changelings (basing my stats on Vampire ... I might be wrong), if you are charismatic you might convince maybe 20 or 30 of them. Not bad at all but far from the 600 you were aiming at.<br /> 2)- on the minus side, everybody stressed out the risk of being discovered and recaptured (which, alone, would be a good reason why most Changelings would be scared by this plan)<br /> 3)- what do you think would be the reaction of most people to &quot;I was abducted by Medusa/Ramplestinskin/ the Snow Queen&quot; ? Even if you can display powers and a disturbing appearance on TV ? Would you believe it or think it's a hilarous hoax ? Who's TV anchor would be ready to cover this crazy thing ?<br /> 4)- After you've been exposed, you'll have a lot of enemies especially if you incorporate other game lines into your Chronicles: Mages would be pissed, the God-Machine would probably dispatch its angels, Vampires would likely think &quot;wtf ??!!?&quot; and investigate the matter and, as far as the other Changelings are concerned, they'll probably go &quot;I'm going to kill these suckers &quot;&quot; etc. The thing is, a lot of (every)supernatural denizens of the world of darkness uphold a Masquerade of sort and will antigonize anyone going public about what lurks in the shadows.<br /> 5)- You forget about Fetches, as you're being hunted down and hiding, no doubt your fetches will go public too, laughing about the good hoax and helping the Government/God-Machine/Mages/Huntsmen/God-knows-who to cover it all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1851,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1851-jps","user":"JPS","date":". 04-24-2016, 01:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1851-jps","name":"JPS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T12:06:01-07:00","id":873212,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JPS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=873175#post873175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not a specialist of Changeling in the CoD (I knew it better in the classical WoD) but I read the Changeling the Lost and, about going public, several thoughts came into my mind:<br /> <br /> 1)- If you think it's a good plan, I bet that other Changelings wouldtoo, but not all of them. Most will be scared. So, if we consider that a big city might have up to 150 Changelings (basing my stats on Vampire ... I might be wrong), if you are charismatic you might convince maybe 20 or 30 of them. Not bad at all but far from the 600 you were aiming at.<br /> 2)- on the minus side, everybody stressed out the risk of being discovered and recaptured (which, alone, would be a good reason why most Changelings would be scared by this plan)<br /> 3)- what do you think would be the reaction of most people to &amp;quot;I was abducted by Medusa/Ramplestinskin/ the Snow Queen&amp;quot; ? Even if you can display powers and a disturbing appearance on TV ? Would you believe it or think it's a hilarous hoax ? Who's TV anchor would be ready to cover this crazy thing ?<br /> 4)- After you've been exposed, you'll have a lot of enemies especially if you incorporate other game lines into your Chronicles: Mages would be pissed, the God-Machine would probably dispatch its angels, Vampires would likely think &amp;quot;wtf ??!!?&amp;quot; and investigate the matter and, as far as the other Changelings are concerned, they'll probably go &amp;quot;I'm going to kill these suckers &amp;quot;&amp;quot; etc. The thing is, a lot of (every)supernatural denizens of the world of darkness uphold a Masquerade of sort and will antigonize anyone going public about what lurks in the shadows.<br /> 5)- You forget about Fetches, as you're being hunted down and hiding, no doubt your fetches will go public too, laughing about the good hoax and helping the Government/God-Machine/Mages/Huntsmen/God-knows-who to cover it all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Damm,I honestly didn't thing how hard it would be like. Of course,a changeling conspiracy could have their leader become a politician,and then use fate altering contract s to win the election. That oughta make it easier","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-25T20:40:41-07:00","id":874233,"title":"","content":"How do you know there isn't an organized group of Loyalists / Privateers / Fetches / etc. just waiting and watching for a Lost who is publicly exposed? And how hard would it be for that group to swoop in and convince everyone that the poor Lost was just an insane human? Straightjacket. Asylum. Never seen again on this earth.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6556-lostlost","name":"LostLost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T04:28:26-07:00","id":874399,"title":"","content":"Even in the best case scenario, Changelings would become public figures. The true fae would suddenly have the help of millions of humans trying to find out every detail of the changeling's life for them--no dream poison required.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm pretty sure that seeing changelings and magic is a breaking point roll at least the first few times it happened... so.... congrats, you just drove a not insignificant portion of the human population insane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T04:36:31-07:00","id":874401,"title":"","content":"there are changelings Who want payback s\u00f3 much that they would do it anyway","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T05:02:31-07:00","id":874412,"title":"","content":"It's not payback though. That's the problem. Going public would benefit the True Fae because they are the embodiment of stories and need attention the way we need air. I imagine right now it's hard for the True Fae to go public when the Integrity trait causes mortals to forget anything overtly supernatural, so instead the True Fae abduct mortals, turn them into changelings and play out their tropes, tales and Feuds so that they can continue existing.<br /> <br /> Going public means humans believe in them again, <i>are going to keep making stories about them</i>, and will continuously provide them with the attention they need to survive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T05:17:42-07:00","id":874425,"title":"","content":"Well, first, lets put down the primary goal of each and every changeling that ever makes it out of the Faerie and the Hedge. &quot;I want to go home.&quot; That's the central conceit of the game. You are called the Lost because you're trying to find your way home. You want to get back into your family, you want to get rid of your fetch, you want your life back. And, to be perfectly blunt, showing off your inhuman features to everyone is not going to get you that life. <br /> <br /> So, why do Changelings have a Masquerade? Having one lets them at least try to fit back into life with humans than be singled out. Having a Masquerade lets them go to brunch with the parents, maybe fall in love, get married, and have a normal family. <br /> <br /> Next, lets talk about the paranoia. They literally are out to get you. Betrayal can come from any direction. Standing out makes you a target - not only for the Gentry, but for other changelings to sell you out to the Huntsmen if necessary. Now, in an ideal world, we would be able to go jogging in a park at night and not be assulted, but in reality, you shouldn't do that. Its not the victim's fault here, but if you take actions that are known to be risky, bad things will likely happen. Same philosophy here. So, to avoid being a target, changelings hide. The fae are nearly unstoppable, but they can't catch you if they can't find you. <br /> <br /> Now, lets talk Mask. Its easier to leave it up than to constantly have it down. Plus, you get to avoid people who might attack you just because of what you suffered. Happens all the time in real life. Someone gets abused, and society blames the victim. You asked for it. You wanted it. The cycle of abuse grows. So instead, you get used to lying about what you are. Its just... easier. Its a pattern. And that makes the next lie easier. And so on. <br /> <br /> And, really, what are the benefits to revealing themselves to the world? It won't make it easier to resist the fae - its simple for the fae to blend into humanity. The only reliable way to test if someone is fae is cold iron, and mass produced iron doesn't count. Meanwhile, fae powers can get you past locked doors, around any security checks, and into anywhere. Fae powers are subtle, and hard to notice. So... what would be the benefit of outting the fae? It won't affect the Gentry/Huntsmen/Loyalist side of things, so what benefit would there be for the Lost to reveal themselves? It might make it easier to out fetches and reconnect with loved ones... but it also just as might backfire. Your loved ones deny you for the fetch as being real. After all, the fetch is the one that's been there for years now. Lots of prejudice around in the world, and being exposed can make you the target of hate crimes. Or your loved ones as well.<br /> <br /> In 2e, we also have that little bit of knowledge that feeding on emotions can drain a person. If the fae were exposed, and that became public knowledge? There would be hell of a backlash on the issue. Its a violation. It would be outlawed, and likely people would make blanket accusations at the fae, and innocents charged. It would be a public outrage, and likely cost the lives of innocent Lost, even if one fed entirely from hedgefruit.<br /> <br /> Simply from a cost-benefit standpoint, there's lots of costs involved, and very dubious benefits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T05:36:27-07:00","id":874438,"title":"","content":"hmmmm,i am forced t\u00f4 admit,yall are right,a revelartion would probably nota work","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T12:47:05-07:00","id":874804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowKnight1224</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/871737-why-do-changelings-have-a-masquerade?p=874412#post874412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not payback though. That's the problem. Going public would benefit the True Fae because they are the embodiment of stories and need attention the way we need air. I imagine right now it's hard for the True Fae to go public when the Integrity trait causes mortals to forget anything overtly supernatural, so instead the True Fae abduct mortals, turn them into changelings and play out their tropes, tales and Feuds so that they can continue existing.<br /> <br /> Going public means humans believe in them again, <i>are going to keep making stories about them</i>, and will continuously provide them with the attention they need to survive.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm reminded of a Halloween episode of the Simpsons where advertising mascots came alive and attacked. The solution: &quot;Just don't look, just don't look.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T14:37:12-07:00","id":874897,"title":"","content":"A mass revelation, no. Now, little revelations do work. Mostly with the friends and family and other loved ones. Like with all things in reality, the extremes of &quot;hide from everyone&quot; and &quot;tell everyone the truth&quot; are both undesirable. You want a blend of the two that works well for you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T21:32:36-07:00","id":875254,"title":"","content":"Besides the mortals who might attack changelings due to fear and misunderstandings, there would be those who would be obsessed with them and try to use them. For example, a crime lord might &quot;politely&quot; ask for a changeling who owes money to smuggle drugs and weapons through the Hedge.<br /> <br /> There's a section for mortal antagonists in Chapter Four of the 1ED Core, including a heir to a wealthy family who has become the ally of a motley, but he's so bored with his life that he wants to become a changeling at all costs, despite all the warnings. Chapter One of Autumn Nightmares goes into more detail about mortal antagonists. Give those a read to have a better notion of why changelings would not want to go public.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}